NNOOTTEESS
       The  verb  generates a new rkey that is different from the previous one
       on its tag part but has the same index (bits 0xffffff00).  A  use  case
       for  this  verb can be to create a new rkey from a Memory window's rkey
       when binding it to a Memory region.

